The project starts with two source files, customerhistory.csv and customerincrement.csv. 
We first ingest both files into the Bronze layer without applying significant transformations. 
In the Silver layer, we clean and standardize the data, perform data quality checks, remove 
duplicates, and implement incremental processing to identify new and updated customer records.
We then merge the historical and incremental data into a trusted Silver customer table. 
In the Gold layer, we apply the required business logic and create a dimensional data model, 
such as a customer dimension and relevant fact tables. Finally, we orchestrate
the complete Bronze-to-Silver-to-Gold pipeline using Databricks Workflows,
add monitoring and data quality checks, and expose the Gold tables for reporting and analytics.

